//RS /// Canonicalize the metadata fields in a rustc-produced Unix archive.
//RS ///
//RS /// Rustc's static-library member order and payloads are already content
//RS /// addressed by the generated source.  The archive container still records
//RS /// process metadata, so normalize those fixed-width fields before publishing
//RS /// the artifact.  This keeps repeated library builds byte-identical without
//RS /// depending on an external `ar` invocation.
